<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><title>白底抠图诊断报告</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#0f0f1a;--card:#1a1a30;--border:#2a2a4a;--text:#c8c8d8;--red:#e74c3c;--yellow:#f39c12;--green:#27ae60}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:-apple-system,"PingFang SC",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);padding:16px}
h1{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:4px}
.summary{display:flex;gap:16px;margin:12px 0;flex-wrap:wrap}
.summary .box{padding:10px 18px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
.box.red{background:#3d2020;border:1px solid var(--red);color:var(--red)}
.box.yellow{background:#3d3020;border:1px solid var(--yellow);color:var(--yellow)}
.box.green{background:#1d3020;border:1px solid var(--green);color:var(--green)}
.section-title{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin:20px 0 8px;padding-bottom:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px;margin:4px 0;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:11px}
.card img{width:80px;height:60px;object-fit:contain;background:#000;border-radius:4px}
.metric{display:inline-block;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;margin:1px;font-size:9px;font-family:monospace}
.metric.red{background:#3d2020;color:#e74c3c}
.metric.yellow{background:#3d3020;color:#f39c12}
.metric.green{background:#1d3020;color:#27ae60}
.metric.blue{background:#1d2d3d;color:#3498db}
.risk-badge{display:inline-block;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;font-weight:700}
.risk-badge.high{background:#e74c3c;color:#fff}
.risk-badge.medium{background:#f39c12;color:#000}
.risk-badge.low{background:#27ae60;color:#fff}
.reason{font-size:9px;color:#e74c3c;margin-left:4px}
.fn{font-weight:700;font-size:11px}
</style></head><body>
<h1>🔬 白底抠图诊断报告</h1>
<p style="font-size:11px;color:#8892a4">分析318张白底图,诊断漫水法可行性. 根因:产品含亮色(>235灰阶)→漫水泄漏</p>
<div class="summary">
<div class="box red">🔴 高风险 必须BiRefNet 250张</div>
<div class="box yellow">🟡 中风险 边缘加固漫水 50张</div>
<div class="box green">🟢 低风险 漫水安全 18张</div>
</div>
<div class="section-title">🔴 高风险 — 产品含亮色/对比度低 → 必须BiRefNet (250张)</div><div class="card">
<img src="/photos/raw/_docx6/image105.jpeg" onerror="this.style.display='none'"/>
<div>
<div class="fn">image105.jpeg <span class="risk-badge high">high</span></div>
<span class="metric blue">边缘255±4</span>
<span class="metric green">对比度106</span>
<span class="metric red">亮部25%</span>
<span class="metric green">阴影Δ0</span>
<div><span class="reason">⚠产品亮部>20%(25%),漫水必漏</span></div>
</div>
</div><div class="card">
<img src="/photos/raw/_docx/image36.jpeg" onerror="this.style.display='none'"/>
